K7PUZtJyLgK8sqgloOmU1Q_trgdQ&oe=6ADF4A93"}, {"file_name": "Recording Radial Pulse Simulator_SS_05.png", "id": "837151848339615", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/43931336_837151851672948_3791241212278429846_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s04IxMPmknAQ7kNvwHXQdwu&_nc_oc=AdqiCABDm-zsS1gSy9lvfM9ZuBGlpJdiiAXDcdJjNFGk3bS7LKtTgFHpivsh-WJT9zE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPqIlMoOq6kvr3BRIlT5FMd76KJyImgKMw3WXgbJphpRA&oe=6ADF75E7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560X1440.png", "id": "3812821238933502", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982527_3812821242266835_422188521434867194_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=akCjTdMMUPQQ7kNvwFMrZR5&_nc_oc=Adr3-L97ECZEgI3AKw6lgA4S31gfBg_QN9AZX9KO5D8vORWmGPQxZenebkD5dyGErxI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMNaZBeqUcmBkcFeqNHePalyNmcOAsLNQY_LxoM_KKG4w&oe=6ADF5BCC"}, "display_name": "Recording Radial Pulse Simulator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This tutorial covers the essential steps for measuring and recording a patient's radial pulse. It includes preparation, locating the pulse, measurement, and documentation. By the end of this tutorial, learners will be able to: \n\nRemember the key steps in recording a radial pulse. \n- Understand the significance of pulse measurement in patient assessment. \n- Apply the correct techniques to ensure accurate pulse recording. \n- Analyze pulse data to detect any irregularities. \n- Evaluate their measurement accuracy and identify areas for improvement. \n- Create precise and thorough patient records based on their findings. \n\nThis comprehensive approach ensures CNAs are well-prepared to assist patients with feeding efficiently and compassionately in real-world clinical settings. ", "short_description": "Develop proficiency in accurately recording a patient's radial pulse."}]}, "developer_name": null, 